{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01ESwWJJgVfvvJKZVSHZzeMc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HjWkStbQd9ieJw5NVhHCtg","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/averri/github/tools/tito-examples/research/smoketest/sessions/run-20260330_182313/sm1_rev.chunk-001.review.md","content":"# Metal Properties\n\n## Iron\n- Atomic number: 26\n- Melting point: 1538 C\n- Density: 7.874 g/cm3\n\n^[Confidence: HIGH, Rationale: All three values for iron are consistent with authoritative external sources. The atomic number (26) and melting point (1538 C) match the Royal Society of Chemistry periodic table entry exactly [WEB:https://periodic-table.rsc.org/element/26/iron]. The stated density of 7.874 g/cm3 corresponds to the accepted standard; the RSC lists 7.87 g/cm3, the minor discrepancy reflects a difference in rounding precision rather than a factual error [WEB:https://periodic-table.rsc.org/element/26/iron].]\n\n## Copper\n- Atomic number: 29\n- Melting point: 1085 C\n- Density: 8.96 g/cm3\n\n^[Confidence: HIGH, Rationale: The atomic number of copper (29) and density (8.96 g/cm3) are confirmed as correct by the Royal Society of Chemistry periodic table [WEB:https://periodic-table.rsc.org/element/29/copper]. The melting point stated as 1085 C is a rounded value of the standard 1084.62 C [WEB:https://periodic-table.rsc.org/element/29/copper]; this rounding is a common convention and does not constitute a factual error.]\n\n## Aluminum\n- Atomic number: 13\n- Melting point: 660 C\n- Density: 2.70 g/cm3\n\n^[Confidence: HIGH, Rationale: All three values for aluminum are confirmed by authoritative external sources. The atomic number (13), melting point (660 C, rounded from the standard 660.323 C), and density (2.70 g/cm3) are consistent with the Royal Society of Chemistry periodic table data [WEB:https://periodic-table.rsc.org/element/13/aluminium]. The minor rounding of the melting point is a standard convention and does not represent a factual error.]\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":117,"cache_creation_input_tokens":526,"cache_read_input_tokens":42516,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":526,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b938b39-8a48-427d-96e8-7bc933523364","uuid":"deb3d090-84ec-4f4e-9f60-3a5b86231d09"}
